caption.p:
(
A
) The levels of CRP and platelets PLT of four patients during hospitalization. The total antibiotic courses and adjustments of antibiotics based on the pathogen metagenomic next-generation sequencing (mNGS) results from ascites or blood in the four patients are shown. (
B
) The levels of D-dimer, PT, and Fg during the hospitalization of four patients. CRP, C-reactive protein; PLT, platelet count; PT, prothrombin time; Fg, fibrinogen.
